id=snap-daily
name=snap-daily
version=v1.4
versionCode=5
author=pantha704
description=05:00 IST camera snap. Installs scripts + crond. Not an LSPosed hook. Daily decision is IST-checked in watch.sh, never a cron hour. v1.2: retry cap, retry window, battery floor, one-snap-per-day sent guard, PIN self-heal, crond watchdog. v1.3: attempts confined to the 05:00-06:00 IST window, Snapchat closed after the day is done so the camera is not left warm, keepalive that re-raises tailscaled / adb 5555 / ssh / wifi from the crond heartbeat, post-fs-data second boot stage. v1.4: unlock by clearing the PIN and swiping instead of restarting SystemUI, which is what left the notification shade stuck open over the keyguard (snap failed 10-05 and 10-06 with "no shutter [focus=NotificationShade]"); shade handling in the wait loop as a fallback.
